  "title": "IDEX Acquires Micro-LAM, Adding Laser-Assisted Machining to Expertise in Optical Technologies",
  "summary": "JULY 30, 2025 – NORTHBROOK, ILLINOIS – IDEX Corporation today announced the acquisition of Micro-LAM, Inc., an advanced manufacturer of laser-assisted machining, ultra-precision diamond tools and custom optics. Micro-LAM, and its subsidiaries, 603 OPTX and M10 Edge, complement the optical technologies solutions within the IDEX Health & Science Technologies segment. “This strategic addition expands IDEX […]",
